+ * but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of
+ * MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the
+ * GNU General Public License for more details:
+ *
+ * Unisoc (Spreadtrum) SoC-integrated modems reached over SIPC: the AT channel
+ * is the WWAN port the kernel's sipc_wwan driver registers, the data path a
+ * sipa_eth network interface.  Ports are claimed by the ID_MM_UNISOC_SIPC udev
+ * tag (77-mm-unisoc-sipc.rules), as the qcom-soc plugin does for its SoCs.
